[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3986425963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962#issuecomment-3986425963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116962","id":3986425963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tnAhr","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T19:30:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T18:53:43Z","body":"Can you talk about how you will use multiple geometries in your game and how lacking this feature prevent you from making your game?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3986425963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3989397323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962#issuecomment-3989397323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116962","id":3989397323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tyV9L","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T08:10:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T18:53:09Z","body":"> Can you talk about how you will use multiple geometries in your game and how lacking this feature prevent you from making your game?\r\n\r\nI'm not making a game. I work as the rendering maintainer for Godot Foundation. I'm trying to make the raytracing API better while it still has not made it into any Godot release, using my experience from raytracing renderers I've written in the past.\r\n\r\nMy reason for allowing multiple geometries is explained in the main post: \r\n> With the previous approach, each Mesh::Surface would have to be its own BLAS. That would not be very efficient due to AABB overlaps and increased TLAS instance count.\r\n\r\nSee this for more reference: https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/best-practices-using-nvidia-rtx-ray-tracing/#organizing_geometries_into_blases","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3989397323/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3991318936","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962#issuecomment-3991318936","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116962","id":3991318936,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7t5rGY","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T14:06:59Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T18:53:18Z","body":"I'm not that familiar with ray tracing in Godot Engine.\r\n\r\nSince you mentioned the word efficient, do you think you this needs a benchmark showing it's better than the Godot Engine status quo? This is some sort of batching / SPMD api I guess.\r\n\r\nLooks cool. Can't wait for someone in the rendering team to take a look.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3991318936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"ho